### EDA Analyzer API Testing
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@sessionId = 94617db8-91e8-4108-8a1a-fcdd73528615

### 1. Upload CSV File
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload_csv/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

name,age,city
John,25,NYC
Jane,30,LA
Bob,35,Chicago
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. Get All Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Session Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get EDA Charts for Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/eda_charts/{{sessionId}}/
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get AI Insights for Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai_insights/{{sessionId}}/
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Column Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/columns/{{sessionId}}/
Accept: application/json

### 7. Generate Custom Charts
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate_charts/{{sessionId}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chart_type": "scatter",
  "x_column": "age",
  "y_column": "salary",
  "title": "Age vs Salary"
}

### 8. Generate On-Demand Charts
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate_on_demand/{{sessionId}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Show me a correlation heatmap of all numeric columns"
}

### 9. Delete Session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/
Accept: application/json

### Upload IRIS Dataset
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload_csv/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="IRIS.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../media/uploads/IRIS.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

