POST {{baseUrl}}/generate_on_demand/{{sessionId}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create a correlation matrix showing relationships between all numeric variables"
}

### Generate Chart from Natural Language - Distribution
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate_on_demand/{{sessionId}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Show me the distribution of the target variable"
}

### Generate Chart from Natural Language - Comparison
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate_on_demand/{{sessionId}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Compare the average values across different categories"
}



### Test Invalid Session ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/
Accept: application/json

